WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
A composite combines constituents to achieve a tailored structure. Direction matters because layered materials may respond differently along and across fibers.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Sketch load parallel and perpendicular to a fiber direction; do not use one isotropic number for both.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Use-case matching

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A material category is not a guarantee of strength, durability or safety. Processing and test conditions matter.

